      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 430,
        "content": "# FREE TEMPLATE — WEBHOOK LEAD COLLECTOR\n\nCredential-free lead collection into an n8n Data Table.\n\n## Setup\n1. Run **SETUP - Create Leads Table** once.\n2. Activate the workflow.\n3. POST to `free-lead-collector`.\n\n## Example\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Alex Morgan\",\n  \"email\": \"alex@example.com\",\n  \"phone\": \"+15551234567\",\n  \"message\": \"I would like more information\",\n  \"source\": \"website\"\n}\n```\n\nThe workflow stores the normalized lead in `free_leads`. No external credentials required."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
